# GitHub's Linguist doesn't know the `.my` extension yet, so my-lisp source
# will be invisible in the repo's language stats for now. We used to map it
# to Common-Lisp, but MyLisp is growing into its own distinct identity.
# We explicitly tag it as MyLisp here in preparation for a future Linguist PR,
# rather than falsely categorizing it as a Common Lisp dialect.
*.my linguist-language=MyLisp
*.lisp linguist-language=Common-Lisp
